e user. See Identity Directory API.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-06-04\nValid as Of: 2025-06-04\nVersion: 27915\n\n--- Record 704 ---\nComponent: Cloud Identity Services\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry,Kyma,Neo\nTitle: SAP Analytics Cloud and SCIM System - new properties\nDescription: New system-specific properties are introduced for SAP Analytics Cloud and SCIM System to hold the path appended to the URL to retrieve the CSRF token.  Previously, this path could be set for these systems via the property csrf.token.path.  See List of Properties → sac.csrf.token.path and scim.csrf.token.path.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-06-04\nValid as Of: 2025-06-04\nVersion: 27915\n\n--- Record 705 ---\nComponent: Identity Provisioning\nEnvironment: Neo\nTitle: SAP Analytics Cloud and SCIM System - new properties\nDescription: New system-specific properties are introduced for SAP Analytics Cloud and SCIM System to hold the path appended to the URL to retrieve the CSRF token.  Previously, this path could be set for these systems via the property csrf.token.path.  For more information, see List of Properties → sac.csrf.token.path and scim.csrf.token.path.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-06-04\nValid as Of: 2025-06-04\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 706 ---\nComponent: Pricing Service\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Document Pricing - Duplication of Structure Conditions\nDescription: An issue caused incorrect duplication of conditions in documents with multiple item hierarchy levels when they were loaded directly from the database. Such documents could also lead to exceptions during recalculation. This issue had to be fixed and can lead to unexpected pricing results if the issue was unnoticed before.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-06-02\nValid as Of: 2025-06-04\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 707 ---\nComponent: SAP AI Core\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Generative AI hub\nDescription: GPT-4 versions 0613 and turbo-2024-04-09 and gpt-4-32k version 0613 have been deprecated.  It's recommended that users of these models migrate to GPT-4.1 as a replacement. For more information, see SAP Note 3437766 .\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: Deprecated\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-06-02\nValid as Of: 2025-06-02\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 708 ---\nComponent: SAP AI Core\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Generative AI hub\nDescription: Gemini-1.5-pro and gemini-1.5-flash have been deprecated.    It's recommended that users of these models migrate to gemini-2.0-flash, or gemini-2.0-flash-lite as replacements.   For more information, see SAP Note 3437766 .\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: Deprecated\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-06-02\nValid as Of: 2025-06-02\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 709 ---\nComponent: SAP AI Core\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Generative AI hub\nDescription: Mistralai--mixtral08x7b-v01 has been deprecated.   It's recommended that users of this model migrate to mistralai--mistral-small-instruct as a replacement.   For more information, see SAP Note 3437766 .\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: Deprecated\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025", "Component: SAP AI Core\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Generative AI hub\nDescription: Mistralai--mixtral08x7b-v01 has been deprecated.   It's recommended that users of this model migrate to mistralai--mistral-small-instruct as a replacement.   For more information, see SAP Note 3437766 .\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: Deprecated\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-06-02\nValid as Of: 2025-06-02\